        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Digital Summer, Underoath\n- Albums: After Hours: Unplugged & Rewired, They're Only Chasing Safety\n- Places: Phoenix, Arizona; Tampa, Florida\n- Genres: hard rock, Christian post-hardcore, acoustic\n\nFacts:\n- Digital Summer is an American hard rock band from Phoenix, Arizona, and it was formed in 2006.\n- Underoath, also stylized as Underøath or UnderOath, is an American Christian post-hardcore band from Tampa, Florida.\n- After Hours: Unplugged & Rewired is the first acoustic album by the Arizona rock band Digital Summer.\n- They're Only Chasing Safety is the fourth album by the American post-hardcore band Underoath.",
